This gives back a reference to a new ndarray view, which is a view into the i-th object in the array [`NpyIter_GetOperandArray`](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/c-api/iterator.html#c.NpyIter_GetOperandArray "NpyIter_GetOperandArray"), whose dimensions and strides match the internal optimized iteration pattern. A C-order iteration of this view is equivalent to the iterator’s iteration order.
