[`PyArray_IterAllButAxis`](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/c-api/array.html#c.PyArray_IterAllButAxis "PyArray_IterAllButAxis") | [`NpyIter_New`](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/c-api/iterator.html#c.NpyIter_New "NpyIter_New") + `axes` parameter **or** Iterator flag [`NPY_ITER_EXTERNAL_LOOP`](https://numpy.org/doc/stable/reference/c-api/iterator.html#c.NPY_ITER_EXTERNAL_LOOP "NPY_ITER_EXTERNAL_LOOP")  
